OL,3,AWestside Cowboy named BBC Introducing  
OL,4,AArtist of the Year 2026                
OL,6,FWestside Cowboy have been announced as 
OL,7,FBBC Introducing Artist of the Year     
OL,8,F2026.                                  
OL,10,FJimmy Bradbury, Reuben Haycocks, Aoife 
OL,11,FAnson O'Connell and Paddy Murphy formed
OL,12,Fthe band in Manchester in 2023 and have
OL,13,Fsince rocketed from the pub circuit to 
OL,14,Fsome of the UK's biggest festivals.    
OL,16,FThe award is presented to an           
OL,17,Fup-and-coming artist or band who has,  
OL,18,Fwith the support of BBC Introducing,   
OL,19,Fmade a significant impact and has      
OL,20,Fpreviously been won by Olivia Dean,    
OL,21,FMyles Smith and Tom Grennan.           
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
