OL,3,AWestside Cowboy named BBC Introducing  
OL,4,AArtist of the Year 2026                
OL,6,FMurphy, from Longridge in Lancashire,  
OL,7,Fsaid the win put them in "good         
OL,8,Fcompany", with Bradbury, from          
OL,9,FShropshire, adding that it was "very   
OL,10,Fflattering".                           
